  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow mono">What we do</span>
        <h2>Tear-offs to touch-ups.</h2>
        <p>If it's a low-slope commercial roof, we work on it — from a full strip-down to bare deck to a same-day leak call. No subcontractor hand-offs: the crew that quotes the job is the crew on your roof.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap" style="padding:0;">
      <div class="grid-services">
        <div class="svc-card">
          <div><span class="svc-num">01</span><h3>Full Tear-Offs & Re-Roofs</h3></div>
          <p>Old built-up roof, modified bitumen, or worn TPO stripped completely to deck and replaced with a new system, built to current code and wind requirements.</p>
